(https://github.com/openai/codex-plugin-cc, version 1.0.6),
Copyright 2026 OpenAI, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Changes from the original: the transport was replaced by the Antigravity CLI
(agy) in headless stream-json mode, with the Gemini CLI as an alternative
engine; the native review was replaced by prompt-based reviews with an enforced
JSON schema; the transfer command was removed; a PreToolUse guard for agy and
Gemini CLI policy files were added; the gemini-monitor mod was added.

